00:06:13,324 --> 00:06:18,190
In the academy slash lesson forty-eight folder you will find the task file,

203
00:06:18,190 --> 00:06:18,774
the data,

204
00:06:18,774 --> 00:06:20,071
the expected output,

205
00:06:20,071 --> 00:06:21,109
and the checker,

206
00:06:21,109 --> 00:06:22,796
check forty-eight dot S H.

207
00:06:23,346 --> 00:06:24,599
You write one file,

208
00:06:24,599 --> 00:06:25,786
inventory dot P Y.

209
00:06:25,786 --> 00:06:27,105
It imports the data,

210
00:06:27,105 --> 00:06:30,337
counts servers per environment with a dictionary,

211
00:06:30,337 --> 00:06:32,711
