213
00:06:34,712 --> 00:06:39,896
The checker runs it and compares with the expected output. Four pass lines to finish.

214
00:06:40,446 --> 00:06:43,795
Do not open the solution file until you have really tried.

215
00:06:44,345 --> 00:06:47,780
Write your results in a report, with the commands and their output.

216
00:06:49,830 --> 00:06:53,755
Here is how your work is judged. Six points, and you need all six.

217
