The checker shows four pass lines.

218
00:06:56,690 --> 00:06:58,951
Busy takes a limit, and returns names.

219
00:06:59,501 --> 00:07:03,405
The counts come from a dictionary and a loop, not hard-coded numbers.

220
00:07:03,955 --> 00:07:06,089
The data is imported, not copied.

221
00:07:06,639 --> 00:07:09,455
The report is complete, including where you got stuck.

